    The research task explicitly encourages exploring how to utilize information from other neurons, which the current baseline ignores by treating them independently. This presents a clear avenue for future research.


    Before attempting any modifications, my next logical step is to examine the system''s actual baseline submission to confirm my understanding of how `defaults.py` is utilized and to prepare for my own first submission, which will aim to replicate this baseline.


