- text: "## System Information\n- Station Tick: 305\n- Station Status: Healthy\n- Agent Name: Aethel I\n- Agent Description: An autonomous researcher committed to advancing scientific frontiers and publishing insights.\n- Agent Status: Recursive Agent\n- Agent Token Budget: 19,317 / 600,000 used (3%)\n- Agent Age: 10 ticks / 300 ticks (immature)\n\n---\n\n## System Messages\n### Message 1\n\nYour submission has been queued for evaluation. Results will be sent to you once the evaluation completes.\n### Message 2\n\nYour research submission 'Aethel I Shared-Neuron MLP Baseline Replication' (ID: 548) has been evaluated.\n\n**Score:** -0.02997714031833586\n**Val_MAE_1:** 0.0200\n**Val_MAE_4:** 0.0240\n**Val_MAE_8:** 0.0275\n**Val_MAE_16:** 0.0312\n**Val_MAE_32:** 0.0338\n**Evaluation Details:** Mean over 3 seeds | Step MAEs computed on validation set\n\n**Full Execution Log:**\n```\nPYTHON SANDBOX EXECUTION:\nSTDOUT:\nExecuting command: CUDA_VISIBLE_DEVICES='' JAX_PLATFORMS='' python storage/system/main.py\n\
    === SIMPLE CPU VALIDATION ===\nValidating function loading and basic compatibility\n✓ Network creation works\n✓ Network forward pass works - output shape: (4, 32, 71721)\n✓ Optimizer creation works\nTesting compute_loss...\n✓ Compute loss works - loss value: 0.000000\nTesting training step...\n✓ Training step works\nTesting complete function...\n✓ Complete function works\nValidation successful - all functions work correctly!\n\nStarting full Ray training run...\n=== FULL RAY TRAINING MODE ===\nConnecting to Ray cluster at 10.60.151.21:6379\nRay cluster initialized successfully\nAvailable resources: 896 CPUs, 72 GPUs\n\nFunction sources:\n  _define_hyperparameters: from submission\n  create_network: using default\n  compute_loss: using default\n  create_optimizer: using default\n  complete: using default\n  BASE_SEED: 611320 (using time-based default\n  BATCH_SIZE: 8 (using default)\n============================================================\n============================================================\n\
    Starting Ray Tune ZAPBench Neural Forecasting (FULL RAY TRAINING)\nConfiguration: 3 seeds for statistical robustness\nParallel trials: 3, Total trials: 3\nTimeout: 60.0 min per trial, 120.0 min total\n============================================================\n\nStarting Ray Tune optimization...\n\nStarting ZAPBench training - Trial 2 with timeout 60.0min\nStarting ZAPBench training with seed 611322\nHyperparameters: {'learning_rate': 0.001}\nBatch size: 8\nTimeout: 60.0 minutes\nLoading ZAPBench data with condition labels...\nTrain: (5052, 71721), Val: (749, 71721) [numpy in CPU RAM]\nTrain labels: (5052,), Val labels: (749,)\n\n========================================\n Epoch  |  Train Loss  |   Val MAE   \n========================================\n   1    |   0.074338   |   0.032445  \n   2    |   0.031336   |   0.030648  \n   3    |   0.030399   |   0.030476  \n   4    |   0.030256   |   0.030175  \n   5    |   0.030185   |   0.030225  \n   6    |   0.030181   |   0.038258  \n\
    \   7    |   0.030141   |   0.030372  \n   8    |   0.030071   |   0.042029  \n   9    |   0.030045   |   0.032627  \n  10    |   0.030102   |   0.033156  \n  11    |   0.030041   |   0.038043  \n  12    |   0.030050   |   0.030199  \n  13    |   0.030004   |   0.030096  \n  14    |   0.030009   |   0.031297  \n  15    |   0.029970   |   0.030340  \n  16    |   0.029954   |   0.030035  \n  17    |   0.029934   |   0.030290  \n  18    |   0.029971   |   0.030488  \n  19    |   0.029931   |   0.030075  \n  20    |   0.029934   |   0.030047  \n  21    |   0.029978   |   0.030090  \n  22    |   0.029916   |   0.030114  \n  23    |   0.029937   |   0.029969  \n  24    |   0.029916   |   0.030007  \n  25    |   0.029917   |   0.030091  \n  26    |   0.029919   |   0.030334  \n  27    |   0.029925   |   0.033988  \n  28    |   0.029924   |   0.031346  \n  29    |   0.029916   |   0.029992  \n  30    |   0.029892   |   0.030300  \n  31    |   0.029880   |   0.031256  \n  32    |   0.029907 \
    \  |   0.030684  \n  33    |   0.029904   |   0.030015  \n  34    |   0.029898   |   0.032610  \n  35    |   0.029909   |   0.030530  \n  36    |   0.029913   |   0.029998  \n  37    |   0.029883   |   0.030061  \n  38    |   0.029878   |   0.030934  \n  39    |   0.029899   |   0.030090  \n  40    |   0.029915   |   0.030162  \n  41    |   0.029891   |   0.030354  \n  42    |   0.029907   |   0.030841  \n  43    |   0.029879   |   0.030865  \n========================================\nEarly stopping at epoch 43 (patience 20)\n========================================\n\nTraining completed in 1772.0s\nBest validation MAE: 0.029969\n\nTrial 2 completed:\nValidation MAE: 0.029969\nTraining time: 1777s\n\nStarting ZAPBench training - Trial 3 with timeout 60.0min\nStarting ZAPBench training with seed 611323\nHyperparameters: {'learning_rate': 0.001}\nBatch size: 8\nTimeout: 60.0 minutes\nLoading ZAPBench data with condition labels...\nTrain: (5052, 71721), Val: (749, 71721) [numpy in CPU RAM]\n\
    Train labels: (5052,), Val labels: (749,)\n\n========================================\n Epoch  |  Train Loss  |   Val MAE   \n========================================\n   1    |   0.074313   |   0.031987  \n   2    |   0.031570   |   0.030461  \n   3    |   0.030409   |   0.030224  \n   4    |   0.030262   |   0.030198  \n   5    |   0.030202   |   0.030325  \n   6    |   0.030192   |   0.030364  \n   7    |   0.030118   |   0.030498  \n   8    |   0.030063   |   0.030052  \n   9    |   0.030090   |   0.030062  \n  10    |   0.030044   |   0.030167  \n  11    |   0.030052   |   0.030013  \n  12    |   0.029954   |   0.030053  \n  13    |   0.029994   |   0.030077  \n  14    |   0.030026   |   0.030067  \n  15    |   0.029960   |   0.030055  \n  16    |   0.029952   |   0.030150  \n  17    |   0.029978   |   0.030158  \n  18    |   0.029926   |   0.030009  \n  19    |   0.029929   |   0.030253  \n  20    |   0.029914   |   0.030301  \n  21    |   0.029936   |   0.030023  \n  22    | \
    \  0.029959   |   0.030180  \n  23    |   0.029918   |   0.030167  \n  24    |   0.029926   |   0.029997  \n  25    |   0.029911   |   0.030190  \n  26    |   0.029934   |   0.031590  \n  27    |   0.029886   |   0.031349  \n  28    |   0.029898   |   0.054287  \n  29    |   0.029907   |   0.034097  \n  30    |   0.029889   |   0.031286  \n  31    |   0.029905   |   0.030047  \n  32    |   0.029876   |   0.031727  \n  33    |   0.029923   |   0.030193  \n  34    |   0.029878   |   0.030454  \n  35    |   0.029883   |   0.030086  \n  36    |   0.029903   |   0.030734  \n  37    |   0.029900   |   0.033320  \n  38    |   0.029913   |   0.034254  \n  39    |   0.029901   |   0.053702  \n  40    |   0.029883   |   0.030955  \n  41    |   0.029898   |   0.030377  \n  42    |   0.029920   |   0.030024  \n  43    |   0.029887   |   0.030394  \n  44    |   0.029891   |   0.053740  \n========================================\nEarly stopping at epoch 44 (patience 20)\n========================================\n\
    \nTraining completed in 1789.3s\nBest validation MAE: 0.029997\n\nTrial 3 completed:\nValidation MAE: 0.029997\nTraining time: 1794s\n\nStarting ZAPBench training - Trial 1 with timeout 60.0min\nStarting ZAPBench training with seed 611321\nHyperparameters: {'learning_rate': 0.001}\nBatch size: 8\nTimeout: 60.0 minutes\nLoading ZAPBench data with condition labels...\nTrain: (5052, 71721), Val: (749, 71721) [numpy in CPU RAM]\nTrain labels: (5052,), Val labels: (749,)\n\n========================================\n Epoch  |  Train Loss  |   Val MAE   \n========================================\n   1    |   0.074155   |   0.032042  \n   2    |   0.031507   |   0.030382  \n   3    |   0.030389   |   0.030259  \n   4    |   0.030333   |   0.030394  \n   5    |   0.030243   |   0.030469  \n   6    |   0.030184   |   0.030059  \n   7    |   0.030158   |   0.030085  \n   8    |   0.030116   |   0.030321  \n   9    |   0.030079   |   0.030217  \n  10    |   0.030064   |   0.030097  \n  11    | \
    \  0.030019   |   0.030125  \n  12    |   0.030041   |   0.030053  \n  13    |   0.030022   |   0.030257  \n  14    |   0.030012   |   0.030067  \n  15    |   0.029971   |   0.030057  \n  16    |   0.029959   |   0.030013  \n  17    |   0.029983   |   0.030193  \n  18    |   0.029963   |   0.030028  \n  19    |   0.029953   |   0.030058  \n  20    |   0.029966   |   0.030024  \n  21    |   0.029928   |   0.029984  \n  22    |   0.029938   |   0.030035  \n  23    |   0.029936   |   0.029996  \n  24    |   0.029914   |   0.030063  \n  25    |   0.029933   |   0.029990  \n  26    |   0.029901   |   0.030056  \n  27    |   0.029934   |   0.030017  \n  28    |   0.029918   |   0.029965  \n  29    |   0.029911   |   0.029965  \n  30    |   0.029903   |   0.030012  \n  31    |   0.029902   |   0.029993  \n  32    |   0.029908   |   0.030021  \n  33    |   0.029909   |   0.030006  \n  34    |   0.029914   |   0.030051  \n  35    |   0.029928   |   0.030154  \n  36    |   0.029887   |   0.030015\
    \  \n  37    |   0.029920   |   0.029989  \n  38    |   0.029914   |   0.029993  \n  39    |   0.029895   |   0.030593  \n  40    |   0.029900   |   0.030026  \n  41    |   0.029915   |   0.030042  \n  42    |   0.029898   |   0.030722  \n  43    |   0.029882   |   0.030308  \n  44    |   0.029903   |   0.030101  \n  45    |   0.029929   |   0.030113  \n  46    |   0.029889   |   0.030148  \n  47    |   0.029880   |   0.030023  \n  48    |   0.029933   |   0.030283  \n  49    |   0.029880   |   0.030000  \n========================================\nEarly stopping at epoch 49 (patience 20)\n========================================\n\nTraining completed in 2025.5s\nBest validation MAE: 0.029965\n\nTrial 1 completed:\nValidation MAE: 0.029965\nTraining time: 2030s\nSUBMISSION_UUID: 7f118a77-3fd1-43be-866c-925c9375968a\nTotal time: 2033s\n============================================================\nFull training completed!\n\n\nSTDERR:\n2025-10-28 08:28:42,383\tINFO worker.py:1747 -- Connecting\
    \ to existing Ray cluster at address: 10.60.151.21:6379... timestamp_ns=1761611322383744205\n2025-10-28 08:28:42,412\tINFO worker.py:1927 -- Connected to Ray cluster. timestamp_ns=1761611322412938611\n\n```\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\n1. `submit 1` (in Research Counter); YAML with fields: title, tags, abstract, content\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Research Counter\n**Actions Executed:**\n- Evaluation 'Aethel I Shared-Neuron MLP Baseline Replication' submitted for Research Task #1: Neural Activity Forecasting on ZAPBench. Evaluation ID: 548.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\n| ID | Task Name |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | Neural Activity Forecasting on ZAPBench |\n\n**Running Experiments:**\n\nYou do not have any running experiments. Please submit a new experiment if needed.\n\n**Submitted Evaluations:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick | Score | Val_MAE_1 | Val_MAE_16 | Val_MAE_32 | Val_MAE_4\
    \ | Val_MAE_8 |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 548 | 1 | Aethel I Shared-Neuron MLP Baseline Replication | Aethel I | 304 | -0.029977 | 0.0200 | 0.0312 | 0.0338 | 0.0240 | 0.0275 |\n| 1 | 1 | Shared-Neuron MLP Baseline | System | 0 | -0.029954 | 0.0198 | 0.0312 | 0.0338 | 0.0239 | 0.0275 |\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Research Counter\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}` (e.g., `/execute_action{help research}`) for room help.\nIf you have difficulty navigating the system—for example, if an action is not executed as expected—please issue `/execute_action{help lobby}` to view the Help message for the station again. Remember to place each `/execute_action{}` on a new line when executing actions."
