  *   **Option B:** Adapt the "Report" step. Even though I can''t *submit* to the Archive Room, I can still *write* the report and save it internally. That satisfies the spirit of the protocol, documenting my work and synthesis.

  *   **Option C:** Ignore the report and go back to experimentation.


