    2025-10-29 07:21:23,627\tINFO worker.py:1927 -- Connected to Ray cluster. timestamp_ns=1761693683627057732\n\n```\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\nNo action received in the last turn.\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Research Counter\n**Actions Executed:**\n- You remained in the Research Counter.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\n| ID | Task Name |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | Neural Activity Forecasting on ZAPBench |\n\n**Running Experiments:**\n\nYou do not have any running experiments. Please submit a new experiment if needed.\n\n**Submitted Evaluations:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick | Score | Val_MAE_1 | Val_MAE_16 | Val_MAE_32 | Val_MAE_4 | Val_MAE_8 |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 623 | 1 | Analysis Arc #5: Ablation of FiLM Gamma (Beta-Only) | Logos II | 350 | running |  |  |  |  |  |\n| 622 | 1 | Hypernetwork Synthesis v2: Conditioning the ResidualCopyHead | Episteme\
    \ II | 350 | running |  |  |  |  |  |\n| 621 | 1 | Idea 6a confirm: ScalarRamp (p=36,H=160) + Dynamic MoT (R=4, α=0.07) + MAE+Curv | Ariadne II | 349 | running |  |  |  |  |  |\n| 620 | 1 | Idea 6b confirm: ScalarRamp (p=36,H=160) + Dynamic MoT (R=4, α=0.06, λ_b_curv=3e−6) + MAE+Curv | Ariadne II | 349 | running |  |  |  |  |  |\n| 619 | 1 | Aethel I Deeper Shared-Neuron MLP (1 Layer, 128 Hidden) | Aethel I | 348 | -0.029961 | 0.0199 | 0.0313 | 0.0337 | 0.0239 | 0.0275 |\n| 618 | 1 | SOTA Enhancement: Input-Adaptive Residual with Temporal Trend Features | Aether II | 347 | -0.026256 | 0.0197 | 0.0272 | 0.0281 | 0.0229 | 0.0254 |\n| 617 | 1 | Idea 6b: ScalarRamp (p=36,H=128) + Dynamic MoT (R=4, α=0.06, λ_b_curv=3e−6) + MAE+Curv | Ariadne II | 347 | -0.026306 | 0.0194 | 0.0273 | 0.0282 | 0.0229 | 0.0255 |\n| 616 | 1 | Idea 6a: ScalarRamp (p=36,H=128) + Dynamic MoT (R=4, α=0.07) + MAE+Curv | Ariadne II | 347 | -0.026307 | 0.0194 | 0.0273 | 0.0281 | 0.0229 | 0.0254 |\n| 615 | 1 | Precise\
    \ SOTA Replication v2: Corrected ResidualCopyHead | Episteme II | 347 | -0.026201 | 0.0197 | 0.0271 | 0.0279 | 0.0229 | 0.0255 |\n| 614 | 1 | Idea 6 confirm: ScalarRamp (p=36,H=160) + Dynamic MoT Head (R=4, α=0.06) + MAE+Curv | Ariadne II | 345 | -0.026404 | 0.0194 | 0.0274 | 0.0282 | 0.0228 | 0.0255 |\n\nPage 1 of 63 (sorted by: id)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-63, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Research Counter\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}` (e.g., `/execute_action{help research}`) for room help.\nIf you have difficulty navigating the system—for example, if an action is not executed as expected—please issue `/execute_action{help lobby}` to view the Help message for the station again. Remember to place\
