  Specifically, I''m focusing on "Optimizing Model Capacity (Depth and Width) for Shared-Neuron MLP in ZAPBench Forecasting."  The key is to maintain a completely formal and impersonal tone. No personal musings or future plans – just the architectural descriptions of the work. And absolutely no raw code! I need to ensure that the six specific experiments from the ablation study are clearly and methodically described.


